@startuml
title GET /api/wallets/{address}/deploys — finalization event stream (WebSocket)
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Wallet holder" as Holder #FFD8C2
participant "EmbersEvents" as Events #E3D8F5
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "WalletsService" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "Validator node" as Validator #FFE4A6
participant "Observer node" as Observer #FFDFC4

group Connect — at EmbersApiSdk construction
Events -> API : GET /api/wallets/{address}/deploys\nUpgrade: websocket
API --> Events : 101 Switching Protocols
API -> Domain : subscribe_to_deploys(address, socket)
Domain -> Validator : subscribe for the address's deploys
Domain -> Observer : subscribe for the address's deploys
end

group Stream — both node types, merged
Validator --> Domain : Finalized { id, cost, errored }
Domain --> Events : { type: "Finalized", deploy_id, cost,\n  errored, node_type: "Validator" }
Events -> Events : node_type is not Observer:\nrecorded by no subscriber callback
Observer --> Domain : Finalized { id, cost, errored }
Domain --> Events : { type: "Finalized", deploy_id, cost,\n  errored, node_type: "Observer" }
Events -> Events : resolve subscribeForDeploy(deploy_id);\nnotify subscribe() callbacks
Events --> Holder : WalletEvent
end

group Reconnect — on close, forever
Events -> Events : wait reconnectDelay\n(1 s, doubling to a 30 s cap;\nreset to 1 s on every successful open)
Events -> API : GET .../deploys (upgrade again)
API --> Events : 101
end

note over Events #FFF0C7
The server streams every finalization for the
address from both nodes; the client dispatches
only Observer reports, because an observer
confirmation is what makes a readback safe.
Deploy identities are lowercase-hex contract
signatures, the same value send returns as
deploy_id.
end note

note over API #FFF6C9
The upgrade carries no authentication: deploy
finalization metadata for an address is public
chain data, like the address's state readback.
end note
@enduml
